-- examples/checks/agg-lattice-strata-ranks.rofl — for the stock evaluator:
-- the ranks rules/strata.rofl cannot give, because telling a read from
-- outside a lattice's recursion from one inside it needs a negation that
-- evaluator cannot order before it reads its table. The program ranks each
-- outer reader of agg-cell-strata-check.rofl above what it reads.
stratum(acst_far, 5).
stratum(acst_reached, 5).
stratum(acst_later, 5).
stratum(acst_crit, 6).
stratum(acst_crit_edge, 5).
